B.a7e=new A.hA("Portfolio & personal photography","Two ways to get in front of the camera.","Artist portfolio shoots for models, actors and brands \u2014 or a personal shoot just for you. Tell us the look and the date; we bring the crew, the wardrobe and the schedule.","talent",null)
B.a7f=new A.hA("Education sector \xb7 AOneGo9 Open School","Learn the craft from the people who book it.","Courses in modelling, acting, makeup, photography, film and design from the AOneGo9 Open School \u2014 alongside verified schools, colleges, universities, classes and coaches.","education",null)
B.a7g=new A.hA("Industry news & media update","What's happening, and what's next.","Fashion, film, music, modelling, production houses and industry bodies \u2014 castings, venues and campaigns, plus the trends crews are actually booking. Submitted stories go live after credentials are checked.","post",null)
B.a7h=new A.hA("On the calendar","Live events, shows, workshops & webinars.","Fashion shows, entertainment programmes, castings, fests and education sessions from AOneGo9 and third-party organisations \u2014 with tickets, registrations and participation in one tap.","crew",null)
B.a7i=new A.hA("AI-assisted event planning","Plan the event. Keep the notebook.","Celebrity events, fashion shows, fests, anniversaries, New Year and summer celebrations \u2014 get a budget split, a timeline and the vendors to book, then run it all from a planning notebook with guests, accounts and tasks.","crew",null)
B.a7j=new A.hA("Onboarding \xb7 free to start","Grow, promote and manage \u2014 in one place.","Artists, businesses, brands, organisations, media and institutions each get a profile built for what they do, and a panel to run it: inventory, tickets, registrations, student records and more.","spaces",null)
B.a7k=new A.hA("Learn from the desk","Workshops in the room. Webinars from anywhere.","Comp card clinics, lighting intensives, scene protocol sessions and post-production pipelines \u2014 hosted by the people who actually run them.","education",null)
B.a7l=new A.hA("The room around the floor","Weeks, guilds, boards, houses, campuses.","AOneGo9 sits next to the weeks, brands and institutions that already run this industry \u2014 so a booking here can walk into a real call sheet.","fashion",null)
B.a7m=new A.hA("The house","A modeling agency that behaves like a production floor.","AOneGo9 is three modules on one desk: a public marketplace, a vendor console, and a super-admin that never lets unverified work onto the floor.","spaces",null)
B.a7n=new A.hA("The people behind the floor","Every listing clears a desk before it clears the door.","AOneGo9 is not an automated directory. Casting, production, verification and editorial are run by people who have worked the sets they are booking for.","talent",null)
B.a7o=new A.hA("Advertise with us","Grow your business with AOneGo9.","Listings, display ads, Instagram & Meta campaigns, and the shoots behind them \u2014 planned and produced by one team.","spaces",null)
B.a7p=new A.hA("Upcoming campaigns","Vote on what we shoot next.","Register your interest in an upcoming portfolio, personal or brand campaign in your city, vote on themes and finalists, and use the coupons that come with them.","fashion",null)
